---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="LacqueredMag is an editorial beauty magazine that argues back. We publish essays on gloss, skin, and the lacquered life."
>
  <article style="max-width: 720px; margin: 80px auto; padding: 0 24px;">
    <span class="eyebrow kicker--accent">About</span>
    <h1 style="margin-top: 16px; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.1;">A print sensibility on a web page.</h1>
    <p style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; color: var(--mute); margin: 16px 0 32px;">
      LacqueredMag is an editorial beauty magazine that argues back.
    </p>

    <div style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75;">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 1.5em;">
        We publish essays on gloss, skin, fragrance, hair, and the lacquered life — long-form pieces in the tradition of <em>Into the Gloss</em>, the rigour of independent print magazines, and the typographic discipline of a wordmark you can read at arm's length.
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 1.5em;">
        We are not a product list. We are not a search-engine answer. We publish by issue, not by day; we run features and interviews alongside dispatches and visual archives; we believe the work of writing well about beauty is the same work as writing well about anything else.
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 1.5em;">
        Each issue carries a single editor's-eye view. We hope you'll read it that way.
      </p>
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 3em 0 1em; padding-top: 1.5em; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);">Editorial policy</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 1.5em;">
        We commission, we edit, and we run a two-pass review on every piece. Product mentions are context — never the spine. Where we have a financial relationship with a brand, we name it in line. Our reviews are independent; our critics are unpaid by the brands they write about.
      </p>
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 3em 0 1em; padding-top: 1.5em; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);">Submissions</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 1.5em;">
        We read pitches on a rolling basis. Send a 150-word outline, three clips, and the working title to <a href="mailto:editors@lacqueredmag.com" style="color: var(--accent);">editors@lacqueredmag.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
